tnc:en`Gameloft: The full version of this game costs CHF 5. You will need to send 1 SMS to purchase the game. Each SMS costs CHF 5 + the cost of a standard SMS according to your messaging plan (you will need to send 1 SMS to purchase the full version). You will receive an SMS with an activation code. Follow the instructions to complete your purchase. You must have sufficient credit to process your order. For more information, visit the Help section of the Gameloft website: support.gameloft.com
